<title>USA: Xechem gets notice of allowance for patent.</title>
<headline>Xechem gets notice of allowance for patent.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xechem International Inc said Thursday the U.S. Patent &amp; Trademark Office has issued notices of allowance for two patents with respect to several of its paclitaxel analogs.</p>
<p>The company said preliminary studies show efficacy against an array of cancer tumor cells.</p>
<p>Xechem is a bio-pharmaceutical company that makes generic and proprietary drugs from natural sources.</p>
